error[SC0203]: a braced initializer is not read yet
   ╭─[ a_braced_initializer_is_refused.c:1:9 ]
   │
 1 │ int x = {1};
   │         ┬  
   │         ╰── this stage reads an expression here, and not a brace
───╯
  = note: C17 6.7.9 p11 makes `= { e }` and `= e` the same thing for a scalar, so dropping the braces is exact wherever the type is one. The form that needs designators and nested lists is for an aggregate, and arrives with structs and arrays
